## Persist manual mapping columns and refresh status

Context: Manual entity mappings could display auto-assigned ID and Label
columns in the Mapping tab while the Status tab still reported them as
unassigned. Manual Apply also read removed summary elements, so those live
assignments were saved as empty values (GitHub issue #158).

Changes:

1. src/front/static/mapping/js/mapping-design.js
   Refresh entity and relationship Status rows from the live shared-panel
   column state whenever the mapping grid changes.
2. src/front/static/mapping/js/mapping-manual.js
   Persist live entity and relationship column assignments, attribute mappings,
   exclusions, labels, and relationship direction from Manual Apply.
3. src/back/core/w3c/r2rml/R2RMLGenerator.py
   Skip incomplete relationship mappings whose source or target ID is absent.
4. tests/units/front/test_manual_mapping_column_state.py
   Add regression contracts for live-state persistence and Status refresh.
5. tests/units/front/test_manual_mapping_panel_host.py
   Cover Manual Apply's use of the shared panel state instead of removed DOM
   summary elements.
6. tests/units/mapping/test_r2rml_generator.py
   Cover incomplete relationship mapping suppression during R2RML generation.

Modified files:
- src/front/static/mapping/js/mapping-design.js
- src/front/static/mapping/js/mapping-manual.js
- src/back/core/w3c/r2rml/R2RMLGenerator.py
- tests/units/front/test_manual_mapping_column_state.py
- tests/units/front/test_manual_mapping_panel_host.py
- tests/units/mapping/test_r2rml_generator.py
- changelogs/v0.8.0/benoitcayladbx_2026-09-03.log

Tests: `uv run --frozen pytest -q
tests/units/front/test_manual_mapping_column_state.py
tests/units/front/test_manual_mapping_panel_host.py` → 18 passed, 0 failed in
0.18s; `uv run --frozen pytest -q -m "not scenario"` → 5843 passed, 304
skipped, 6 deselected, 1 xfailed, 0 failed in 51.45s.

Browser verification: Manual Mapping at `/mapping/?section=manual` auto-assigned
`AS ID` and `AS Label`, immediately showed green/current Status values, and
persisted both assignments after Apply and reload. Relationship source/target
status also remained green. No console, failed-request, or HTTP errors were
observed.
